sentences.l:
if any fortune meanwhile should have come,
neither to draw up should they dare a battle-line nor to trust the field;
the camp only and, safe by the mound, they should keep the walls.

sentences.t:
Turnus ut ante volans tardum praecesserat agmen
viginti lectis equitum comitatus, et urbi
improvisus adest;

sentences.l:
Turnus, as ahead flying the slow he had outstripped column,
by twenty picked of the horsemen attended, and at the city
unlooked-for is present;

sentences.t:
Ac veluti pleno lupus insidiatus ovili
cum fremit ad caulas, ventos perpessus et imbris,
nocte super media;

sentences.l:
And as when, at a full lying in ambush, a wolf, sheepfold,
when he growls at the pens, having endured winds and rains,
at night, past the middle;
